.SH "NAME"
roark\-call\-list \- List calls
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.B roark call list
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Returns a paginated list of calls for the authenticated project.
.SH "API"
GET /v1/call
.SH "OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<value>\fR
Maximum number of calls to return (default: 20, max: 100) Optional.
.TP
\fB\-\-after\fR \fI<value>\fR
Cursor for pagination \- use the nextCursor value from a previous response Optional.
.TP
\fB\-\-sort\-by\fR \fI<value>\fR
Field to sort by (default: createdAt) One of: createdAt, startedAt, endedAt, duration, title, status. Optional.
.TP
\fB\-\-sort\-direction\fR \fI<value>\fR
Sort direction (default: desc) One of: asc, desc. Optional.
.TP
\fB\-\-status\fR \fI<value>\fR
Filter by call status One of: RINGING, IN_PROGRESS, ENDED. Optional.
.TP
\fB\-\-search\-text\fR \fI<value>\fR
Search text to filter calls by title, summary, or transcript Optional.
.TP
\fB\-\-simulation\-run\-plan\-job\-id\fR \fI<value>\fR
Filter by simulation run plan job ID to get all calls from a specific simulation batch Optional.
.TP
\fB\-\-simulation\-run\-plan\-job\-ids\fR \fI<value>\fR
Calls from any of these simulation runs (run plan job ids), comma\-separated, at most 100 Optional.
.TP
\fB\-\-simulation\-run\-plan\-ids\fR \fI<value>\fR
Calls from every run of any of these run plans, comma\-separated, at most 100 Optional.
.TP
\fB\-\-counted\-in\-results\fR \fI<value>\fR
true: only simulated calls their run's results count (not invalidated, for example because the agent never spoke). false: only the simulated calls the results leave out, each invalidated. Live calls, and calls removed from their run, match neither. One of: true, false. Optional.
.TP
\fB\-\-exclude\-hidden\-runs\fR \fI<value>\fR
true: leave out calls from runs hidden from the runs list. Live calls stay in. false is the same as leaving it out. One of: true, false. Optional.
